# Wall sign (R12, wall mount): a clinic cross in cyan neon line art quantized from generated art
# (tools/voxel-forge/art/bb_pharmacy.png, local ComfyUI Qwen-Image); cyan tube edge.
grid 10
size 4 28 28
slot frame Ink
slot face NeonCyan
slot edge NeonCyanEdge
slot bracket Steel
pivot 0 14 0
box 0 4 4 2 6 24 bracket
box 0 22 4 2 24 24 bracket
box 2 0 0 3 28 28 frame
box 3 0 0 4 28 28 edge
box 3 1 1 4 27 27 frame
image ../art/bb_pharmacy.png 3 2 2 24 24 frame 0.07 face 0.5 edge
